meta {
  name: SuperUser - List Role Settings
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/role-settings
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # SuperUser - List Role Settings

  All 12 fixed roles with their display settings and how many users hold each.
  Roles with no saved row return their defaults.
  Requires: SuperUser (403 otherwise).

  ## Response
  ```json
  [
    {
      "role": "Requestor", "label": "Requestor", "description": "Raises requests",
      "isActive": true, "sortOrder": 1, "userCount": 210, "locked": false
    },
    {
      "role": "SuperUser", "label": "SuperUser", "description": "...",
      "isActive": false, "sortOrder": 12, "userCount": 2, "locked": true
    }
  ]
  ```
  `isActive` = shown in the user-form dropdown. `locked` roles can never be shown.
}
